From 11324f0933e71fea62293953005ab0e2c5619e6c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Horizon authors <>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 17:43:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Tamer looks: ten shirts in sixteen colours, chosen on the
 Look page

---
